  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Heat hot pepper sauce, butter, cumin, chili powder, red pepper flakes, white pepper, and fresh chile pepper in a pot over medium heat. Simmer until flavors have developed and sauce is thickened, about 1 hour.",
